            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "`os_exit()` calls `ui_client_stop()`, which sets `ui_client_attached = false`. `parse_msgpack()` will not call UI event handlers when `ui_client_attached == false`, so this means `ui_client_attached` gets set to `true` somewhere during `os_exit()`. That seems to be a bigger problem, so I don't think the change in `tui_flush()` is correct.",
